# Third-party corpora / engines (D6-009, revised): datasets, captures and
# full upstream checkouts never enter the tree - they are fetched out-of-tree
# into .corpus/ with a pinned sha256.  Curated *rule* files are the exception:
# tests/conformance/rules/ is committed because DRL-1.1 permits redistribution
# with attribution (tests/conformance/ATTRIBUTION.md).
